; Tables Within Functions Without Assignment

; Let's start by designing a memoized properly recursive Fibonacci function. By making use of a local
; table, your function should input an integer n>=0 and compute the nth Fibonacci number without computing
; any kth Fibonacci number, k < n, more than once. You should use R5RS scheme rather than #lang eopl.

; You will find it helpful to read section 2.3 of EOPL before beginning. 